{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/OpenAPI\/Document\/components"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/OpenAPI","doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/OpenAPI\/Document"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit\/openapi\/document\/components"]}],"metadata":{"title":"components","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO8DocumentV10componentsAC10ComponentsVvp","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"components","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OpenAPI","preciseIdentifier":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Components","preciseIdentifier":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO10ComponentsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Storage for components that need to be referenced elsewhere in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPI Document using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OpenAPI.References"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"components"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO","text":"OpenAPI","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/OpenAPI"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO10ComponentsV","text":"Components","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/OpenAPI\/Components"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Storing components here can be in the interest of being explicit about","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the fact that the components are always the same (such as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“Unauthorized” ","type":"text"},{"code":"Response","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" definition used on all endpoints) or it might","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"just be practical to put things here and reference them elsewhere to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cut down on the overall size of the document.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If your document is defined in Swift then this is a less beneficial way to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"share definitions than to just use the same Swift value multiple times, but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you still might want to consider using the Components Object for its impact","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the JSON\/YAML structure of your document once encoded.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://OpenAPIKit/documentation/OpenAPIKit/OpenAPI/Document/components":{"abstract":[{"text":"Storage for components that need to be referenced elsewhere in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenAPI Document using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OpenAPI.References"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"components","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openapikit\/openapi\/document\/components","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"components"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10OpenAPIKit0A3APIO","text":"OpenAPI"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifi